    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN45ZE4JFR1B1S4VKCDH7P\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to add an image in a text block in a Klaviyo email. While in most cases you should insert images into your email templates using image blocks, there might be some cases when you'd prefer to have text and an image within the same block.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>If you'd like to set an image as a background for your text, head to our article on <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005255968\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">setting background images for a section</a>. </p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN45ZFT9B89RZ1E0BA85F4\">Host your image</h2>\n<p>Once you have your image sized and edited appropriately (using a photo editing tool of your choice),  upload the image to Klaviyo. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Content &gt;</strong> <strong>Images &amp; brand</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Upload images</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34368919318427\" alt=\"Images &amp; brand image upload.png\">\n</li>\n<li>Select an image (or images) to upload.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Back to upload </strong>when your image has finished uploading.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Close</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click on the three-dot menu beside the image you just uploaded.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Preview</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34368909505819\" alt=\"Brand &amp; images preview.png\">\n</li>\n<li>Highlight and copy the URL from the search bar at the top of your browser.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28705635531675\" alt=\"An image's URL is highlighted\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If you ever then want to delete an image from the Images &amp; brand library:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Locate the image you want to delete.</li>\n<li>Click on the three-dot menu beside the image.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Delete.</strong><strong><br></strong>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN45ZF18A1XHFDMJZ5APYA\">Add an image in a text block</h2>\n<p>To add the image you uploaded to a text block in a Klaviyo email: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the email template editor. </li>\n<li>Double click on the text block where you'd like to add the image.</li>\n<li>Click the image icon.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31187355531547\">\n</li>\n<li>Paste the URL from step 8 above into the <em>Image URL</em> field.</li>\n<li>Optional: add alt text and set a height or width for the image.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Apply</strong>. </li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HCJN45ZF3VN7P76XKFNE3F3D\">Additional resources</h2>\n<p>Interested in learning more about personalizing your emails with customer details? Check out our article on <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005084927\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">message personalization</a>.</p>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
